    "Con": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con 3 carreras de 3 km o más en los últimos 90 días, HÅLSYN estima tus tiempos para 5 km, 10 km, media maratón y maratón.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With 3 runs of 3 km or more in the last 90 days, HÅLSYN estimates your times for the 5K, 10K, half marathon and marathon."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med 3 löppass på minst 3 km under de senaste 90 dagarna uppskattar HÅLSYN dina tider på 5 km, 10 km, halvmaraton och maraton."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con FC en reposo %@, FC máx. %@ corriendo y %@ en bici.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using resting HR %@, max HR %@ running and %@ cycling."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med vilopuls %@, maxpuls %@ vid löpning och %@ på cykel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con FC en reposo %@, FC máx. %@ corriendo y %@ en bici. Sin sexo en tu perfil, se usa la media de las curvas de hombres y mujeres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Using resting HR %@, max HR %@ running and %@ cycling. With no sex in your profile, the average of the men's and women's curves is used."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med vilopuls %@, maxpuls %@ vid löpning och %@ på cykel. Utan kön i din profil används medelvärdet av kurvorna för män och kvinnor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con cambios de ritmo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With pace changes"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med tempoväxlingar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con diabetes cuenta la HbA1c. Sin diabetes vale cualquiera de los dos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you have diabetes, HbA1c is what counts. Without diabetes, either one works."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med diabetes räknas HbA1c. Utan diabetes går det bra med vilket som helst av dem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con diabetes hace falta la HbA1c.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you have diabetes, HbA1c is required."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med diabetes behövs HbA1c."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el resultado se recalculan tu forma, tus ritmos y si el objetivo es alcanzable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The result is used to recalculate your fitness, your paces and whether your goal is achievable."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med resultatet räknas din form, dina tempon och om målet är nåbart om."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la mejora habitual hasta la carrera": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With typical improvement by race day"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med normal förbättring fram till loppet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la vuelta automática cada kilómetro, «Cada 5» habla en los kilómetros 5, 10, 15… En bici, el ritmo se dice como velocidad.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the auto lap every kilometer, “Every 5” speaks at kilometers 5, 10, 15… On the bike, pace is announced as speed."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med automatiskt varv varje kilometer pratar ”Var 5:e” vid kilometer 5, 10, 15 … På cykeln sägs tempot som hastighet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con recordatorio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With reminder"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med påminnelse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con ritmo objetivo, el reloj avisa si vas más rápido o más lento durante la serie.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With a target pace, the watch lets you know if you're going faster or slower during the rep."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med ett måltempo meddelar klockan om du springer snabbare eller långsammare under draget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu FTP de %@ W. Una hora entera a tu FTP son 100 de carga; la intensidad es la ponderada dividida entre el FTP.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your FTP of %@ W. One full hour at your FTP is a load of 100; intensity is the weighted power divided by your FTP."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med din FTP på %@ W. En hel timme på din FTP ger belastningen 100; intensiteten är den viktade effekten delad med FTP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu FTP, el reloj muestra en qué zona de potencia vas (Z1–Z7) y el iPhone calcula la intensidad y la carga de cada salida.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your FTP, the watch shows which power zone you're in (Z1–Z7) and the iPhone calculates the intensity and load of each ride."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med din FTP visar klockan vilken effektzon du ligger i (Z1–Z7) och iPhone beräknar intensitet och belastning för varje cykeltur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu forma actual": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
