    "Se borran las semanas del plan y la sesión del día enviada al reloj. Tus carreras y tus resultados de tests se conservan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan's weeks and today's session sent to the watch are deleted. Your runs and test results are kept."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Planens veckor och dagens pass som skickats till klockan raderas. Dina löprundor och testresultat sparas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se calcula con tu sueño, tu HRV y tu FC en reposo de esta noche.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's calculated from last night's sleep, HRV and resting HR."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den beräknas utifrån nattens sömn, HRV och vilopuls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se durmió": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fell asleep"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somnade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se enviarán al Apple Watch cuando esté disponible.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They'll be sent to your Apple Watch when it's available."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De skickas till din Apple Watch när den är tillgänglig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se oye la balanza pero todavía no manda el peso. Súbete y espera a que el número quede fijo en la pantalla de la balanza.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The scale is heard but isn't sending a weight yet. Step on and wait until the number holds still on the scale's display."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vågen hörs men skickar ingen vikt än. Kliv på och vänta tills siffran står still på vågens display."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se oyen equipos Xiaomi cifrados, pero ninguna balanza que mande el peso sin cifrar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encrypted Xiaomi devices are heard, but no scale sending an unencrypted weight."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krypterade Xiaomi-enheter hörs, men ingen våg som skickar vikten okrypterad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se paró antes del minuto: no hay valor para guardar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It stopped before one minute: there's no value to save."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den stoppades före en minut: det finns inget värde att spara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
